   "post_data": {
    "post_id": 367453,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 61046,
    "poster_id": 1991,
    "post_rendered": "Determine the polynomials P of two variables so that:<br>\n<br>\n<b>a.)</b> for any real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/3/aa34c62b93a1adcdfe27f7dad52fa9bed68f95f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t,x,y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" > we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/9/d59185a0ede0d6e70d8bb1d1415f55e6e4f63bc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(tx,ty) = t^n P(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"164\" height=\"18\" > where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\"  width=\"10\" height=\"8\" > is a positive integer, the same for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/8/9a854d5f125e103b8d1f8ed7ef1287ccd75cef65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t,x,y;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" ><br>\n<br>\n<b>b.)</b> for any real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" > we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/b/4ab3b2774e7277e76bc93e5d08ccded1cceb7895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(a + b,c) + P(b + c,a) + P(c + a,b) = 0;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"333\" height=\"18\" ><br>\n<br>\n<b>c.)</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/7712d46c27cb39234fb20ac3c0ce57f714bab086.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(1,0) =1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" >",
    "post_canonical": "Determine the polynomials P of two variables so that:\r\n\r\n[b]a.)[/b] for any real numbers $t,x,y$ we have $P(tx,ty) = t^n P(x,y)$ where $n$ is a positive integer, the same for all $t,x,y;$\r\n\r\n[b]b.)[/b] for any real numbers $a,b,c$ we have $P(a + b,c) + P(b + c,a) + P(c + a,b) = 0;$\r\n\r\n[b]c.)[/b] $P(1,0) =1.$",
    "username": "orl",
    "post_number": 1,
    "post_format": "bbcode",
    "category_name": "High School Olympiads",
    "category_id": 6,
    "poster_avatar": "//avatar.artofproblemsolving.com/avatar_1991.jpg"
   }
