    "poster_id": 2639,
    "post_rendered": "When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/a/d4adb28e3f5c2257cfd5bd4ab5ee3ea48d1ec889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4444^{4444}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" > is written in decimal notation, the sum of its digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/4/124ca54dab4f6f27a549cacf6f1e350421a28a7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ A.$\"  width=\"17\" height=\"13\" > Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > be the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/8207b79435a4bd499da7598fb44424c8a8499238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A.$\"  width=\"17\" height=\"13\" > Find the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/5/51535c2d1cbf8457b1fb9355bf6a1a9e9548abdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ B.$\"  width=\"18\" height=\"12\" > <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\"  width=\"13\" height=\"13\" ></span> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > are written in decimal notation.)",
    "post_canonical": "When $4444^{4444}$ is written in decimal notation, the sum of its digits is $ A.$ Let $B$ be the sum of the digits of $A.$ Find the sum of the digits of $ B.$ ($A$ and $B$ are written in decimal notation.)",
